    notifications: { q: 'How do I turn on notifications?', a: 'In {me}, turn on notifications for this device to hear when your partner sends a plan or a note, on Sunday and Wednesday, and before your dates. On iPhone, add Belluh to your Home Screen first (Share, then Add to Home Screen). If they’re blocked, allow them in your browser’s site settings.' },
